+  Replaces all tagged unions with structs representing underlying the tag and the untagged union
+
+## Compact Layout
+
+A tagged union whose members are one pointer (or a wrapped type of a pointer)
+plus one or more zero sized members (void or wrapped types of void) is stored
+as a single word with the size and alignment of a pointer.
+The word holds either the pointer or the typeid of the zero sized member.
+This relies on typeids being smaller than the address of any object:
+Cwerg executables are loaded at 0x400000 (x64, a64) or 0x20000 (a32)
+and the stack and heap are placed above the image.
